    {
      "name": "book_tour",
      "description": "Books a tour time from get_tour_slots. Step 1, without confirm_token: returns a preview of the details and a confirm_token (valid 10 minutes); nothing is saved. Show the preview to the person. Step 2, with the same details and the confirm_token: books the tour (status 'booked'; Calendly emails the person a confirmation and calendar invite) and passes the details to CANOPY's sales team. At a location that can't take direct bookings yet, step 2 instead returns a Calendly link with the details filled in (status 'link_issued') for the person to confirm. Only call step 2 after the person agrees.",
